"the-context-problem","children":"The Context Problem"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"Consider a typical incident response workflow:"}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Detect"}]," - Alert fires in Alertmanager"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Diagnose"}]," - Gather logs, metrics, and traces"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Remediate"}]," - Execute runbook steps"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Document"}]," - Generate post-mortem"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"If each step runs as an independent LLM call, the system loses context between steps. The remediation step doesn't know what the diagnosis found, and the documentation step doesn't know what actions were taken."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"plugin-scoped-memory","children":"Plugin-Scoped Memory"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["In AI Crew Suite, each plugin maintains a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"session-based memory"}]," that persists throughout a workflow execution. This memory is scoped to:"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Plugin instance"}]," - Separate memory per plugin"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Workflow execution"}]," - Memory cleared when workflow completes"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"User session"}]," - Memory can optionally persist across multiple interactions"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"language-typescript","children":"type PluginMemory = {\n  sessionId: string;\n  workflowId: string;\n  evidence: Record<string, Evidence>;\n  decisions: Decision[];\n  context: Record<string, any>;\n};\n"}]}]}],"\n",["$","